{"3708250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Heaven's Dale", "steam_appid": 3708250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A Sacrifice...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your life ends before its time for an unknown reason. The Moon Goddess herself offers you rebirth. But why does she look so sad?...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" width=816 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.webm?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A New Life!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Heaven’s Dale is a cozy life sim centered around your carpenter workshop. Restore and rebuild the town, help repair what was lost, grow crops, explore caves, raise seahorses, spend peaceful days fishing or take a travel to the moon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b172e01d235025028db140475cd5a40c.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" width=822 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b172e01d235025028db140475cd5a40c.webm?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b172e01d235025028db140475cd5a40c.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>That's Not All...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a brand new world, the Purple Moon! Uncover what happened in Heaven’s Dale, and who you truly are!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/4b8df57b45b4c28f7937554e2b6fab85.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" width=1068 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/4b8df57b45b4c28f7937554e2b6fab85.webm?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/4b8df57b45b4c28f7937554e2b6fab85.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Something Isn't Right...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The former owner disappeared? You can see the dead? What is happening in the world beyond Heaven’s Dale? Who are the dwarves?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/25a6821496cabfcf8a4a0f24a8f5e2a9.webp?t=1784653892\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/25a6821496cabfcf8a4a0f24a8f5e2a9.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1128 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Many Goals!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Is the Moon Temple destroyed? Embark on a mission to help the Moon Fairies restore everything!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.webm?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>More about!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect resources and repair structures around Heaven's Dale </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant seeds and make nectars using the carpentry barrels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take care of the happiness of ranch animals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend rainy days fishing near your house or in the forest </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the lost diary and uncover the story of the former owner of the carpentry workshop </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take care of a seahorse ranch in the sea </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect furniture while exploring and decorate your house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete quests, achievements, explore the mines...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tools change automatically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Invite a homeless person to your barn and decorate his place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Made with Love!</strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.poster.avif?t=1784653892\" width=1060 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.webm?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;My Heaven’s Dale started as a casual experiment in 2024. At the beginning, I had zero experience with both art and programming. People started to enjoy what I was making, so I decided to pursue the project as a true ambition in my life.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/48c3923b56df7bda2046a0ceaeb90ead.avif?t=1784653892\" width=678 height=248 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A Sacrifice...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your life ends before its time for an unknown reason. The Moon Goddess herself offers you rebirth. But why does she look so sad?...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka