tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.mp4?t=1784653892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;My Heaven’s Dale started as a casual experiment in 2024. At the beginning, I had zero experience with both art and programming. People started to enjoy what I was making, so I decided to pursue the project as a true ambition in my life.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/48c3923b56df7bda2046a0ceaeb90ead.avif?t=1784653892\" width=678 height=248 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sent by the Moon Goddess, you arrive in Heaven’s Dale to run a carpenter workshop and uncover its former owner’s fate. Mysterious ghosts drift through everywhere! Live a cozy life planting, fishing, mining, and caring for animals while restoring the town at your own pace.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "reviews": "“My Heaven’s Dale features adorable pixel graphics that always transport me straight back to my childhood.”<br>GamingBible<br><br>“The fishing is especially easy and satisfying. Some fishing games can be so hard… you know who you are!!”<br>LadiesGamers<br><br>“congrats on making this hidden gem of a game it deserves a lot more attention!!”<br>Steam Community<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/46e25b2f826ca8aebf4540d5ee23dcb9a04acdbb/header.jpg?t=1784653892", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/0231db3aa78ff90b44da639fa29664a5c98aaec8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784653892", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/370